text 3 pm.
text I finish painting the chairs and the table.
text I worked really carefully and they came out great, if I do say so myself.
text @[Tomoya]
text Not bad at all.
text I also want to return the garden to its former glory.
text But to do that, I need to know more about gardening.
text While grinning in satisfaction at the white chair, my stomach growls.
text I decide to head to the station for food.
text @[Tomoya]
text Kotomi, are you getting enough to eat?
text I call out to the window on the second floor.
text Naturally, no answer.
text I don't care if she's hiding somewhere while watching me.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm going out for a bit, but I'll be back.
text @[Tomoya]
text You should get something to eat too!
text I change out of my paint-splattered clothes and get ready to go.
