text By the time I leave, dusk is approaching.
text I go to an ATM and withdraw everything in my account.
text This is the money I saved up to get out of that damned house.
text In the end, I never got a chance to spend it and completely forgot I had it.
text Now I want to thank my delinquent self.
text @[Tomoya]
text Next up is the hardware store...
text It's close enough to walk to, but I don't have much time.
text I decide to take the bus from the station.
text As I walk quickly at the edge of the sidewalk, a bench on the other side of the street catches my eye.
text Three female students wearing my school's uniform are sitting on it.
text Going to school on a Sunday? Wait, the Founder's Festival ceremony is today.
text I wonder what Furukawa and the others are doing.
text One of them turns around on the bench and sees me.
