text I run over to them, but they're still seated when I get there.
text Something seems wrong.
text On one side of the bench is a familiar violin case.
text @[Tomoya]
text Isn't that the violin from the other day? You borrowed it again?
text No one answers.
text I notice that there's something wrong with the case.
text The hinge is coming off and the latch is bent.
text I pick it up and open the lid.
text @[Tomoya]
text Whoa...
text I groan in surprise.
text The violin is cracked in half.
text The neck part with the strings is completely separated from the body.
text The front side of the body is scraped up and split open.
text @[Tomoya]
text What happened to it?!
text Still no answer.
text When I try to ask one more time...
text Kyou answers, her head still down.
