text @[Tomoya]
text I should quit.
text I mumble this to myself and throw down the shovel.
text Without the sounds of digging, the chirping of the insects becomes deafening.
text In my memory, this garden used to be the most enjoyable place in the world.
text No one can return it to its original state.
text I shrug on my jacket and start putting away the tools.
text I'm scared.
text Nothing but darkness awaits me at the end of my pointless struggles.
