text The dry night wind feels good on my cheeks.
text Turning around once more, I whisper to myself...
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll be waiting for you at school, Kotomi.
text And I walk away.
text I walk quickly, as if running from something.
text I will never come to Kotomi's garden ever again.
text I can feel it.
