text One of the stars approaches me.
text I feel something strange in exchange, like something lost is returning to me.
text I can tell that my consciousness is fading.
text As if being wrapped in something warm, I fall into a slumber.
sound ~
label 35
delay 180
jump SEEN4512_0_0.scr
label 36
